config APP_FEATURE_DIAG_MONITOR
	bool "Periodic diagnostics monitor thread (stack + heap dump)"
	default n
	select THREAD_ANALYZER
	help
	  Master switch for development RAM / heap tuning. Enables a
	  low-priority background thread that periodically dumps thread
	  stacks, heap stats, and LVGL pool usage over RTT.
	  Tuning Kconfig: Kconfig.diag_monitor.
	  Zephyr overlay: conf/features/diag_monitor.conf (auto-merged when y).
	  Does not enable THREAD_ANALYZER_AUTO — diag_monitor owns dump cadence.

endmenu

